@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Plan
+
+1. Update the customer-order admin endpoint to query by the supplied customer ID directly, return an empty result with zero totals when there are no matching orders, and only attach customer details when the account still exists.
+2. Make order detail loading resilient to deleted customers and optional child collections while preserving the existing order populator output, status updates, history, and payment transaction lookups.
+3. Correct modern order-list pagination and metadata: apply page zero-based offsets, calculate ceiling page counts, preserve matching totals on empty/out-of-range pages, and keep newest-first filtered results.
+4. Add focused regression coverage at the repository/facade/API level for deleted-account orders, customer-ID order history, account replacement isolation, filters, exact/page-boundary totals, and out-of-range pages.
+5. Run the relevant module tests first, then the repository Maven build/tests that are practical in the available environment; report any infrastructure or fixture limitations.
